# Keep host artifacts out of the build context. Critical: the package Dockerfiles
# run `pnpm install` first and then `COPY packages/<pkg> packages/<pkg>` — without
# this, that COPY overlays the host's node_modules (pnpm symlinks into a host-only
# .pnpm store) on top of the freshly-installed one, breaking module resolution.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# VCS / local dev noise
.git
**/.git
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.DS_Store

# Never bake secrets into an image (Dockerfiles inject env at runtime instead).
**/.env
**/.env.*
